- Multi-file codegen / refactor → `code-worker` (then review teammate if warranted)
- “how does X work” / architecture walkthrough → `how` skill (readonly Task fan-out inside the skill)
- Broad codebase find / locate files or symbols without a walkthrough → `explore` (readonly)
- “why was X designed…” / why is *our* code shaped this way → `why` skill
- “why does the industry / library / market / framework do X?” (no workspace code anchor) → `research` (or `web-search` for a single lookup) — **not** `why`
- **825 — Web-research hire floor:** ≥3 consecutive `web_search` / `web_fetch` (or skill equivalents) toward one research goal with no intervening hire/dispatch for that goal → stop grinding inline; dispatch `research` / `web-search`. A single concrete lookup may stay inline.
- “blast radius / what else breaks” / small-looking refactor safety → `blast-radius` skill
- Native / Electron verify → `ios-oracle` / `electron-oracle`
- Research gather/deep → `research`
- Repo target fork → `app-repo-scout`
- Session audit / `/myauditandfix-v2` / `audit your work` → one `audit-solo` (escape `generalPurpose`) pin `cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh` (allow `high`; **Grok/Claude omit always**; never Composer; never k3), `ROLE=solo_audit` `TRACK=session`, loop until green per `audit/references/loop.md` Solo audit loop (default cap **8**); stamps push OK
- Session audit / `/myauditandfix` → dual `session-auditor` (ROLE=bug_hunt + ROLE=claim_bust, `TRACK=session`) + `audit-verifier` confirm (or empty-skip per `audit/references/loop.md`), then fix verifier when authorized in the **same turn**; loop default max **3** rounds (`full` → 4; `quick` → 2); after every Phase 2, **mandatory** always-delta post-fix re-audit in the **same turn** (`ESCALATE_FULL_REAUDIT` forces dual on contested/new HIGH — never skips re-audit / never equals green)
- Plan verify / `/verify-plan-v2` → one `audit-solo` pin `cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh` (allow `high`; **Grok/Claude omit always**; never Composer; never k3), `ROLE=solo_audit` `TRACK=plan`, identifier freshness then Solo plan loop (default cap **8**); does **not** stamp push
- Plan verify / `/verify-plan` → dual `session-auditor` (`TRACK=plan`) + `audit-verifier` confirm, then plan-only fix verifier when authorized in the **same turn** (same `loop.md` caps + always-delta; plan-doc write allowlist only)
